### Permitted Use

This handbook, including its curriculum structure, lessons, exercises, solutions, break-and-fix challenges, reference application source code (AdmitFlow), case studies, interactive tools, and instructional designs, is made publicly accessible for **personal learning, individual study, and educational reference**.

You are encouraged to:
- Read, study, and follow all 12 modules and interview-prep materials.
- Run, test, and adapt the exercise and project code in your personal learning environment.
- Star, fork, and link to this repository to share with fellow learners and developers.

